                                                    UNPACKLIB(11)NAME     unpacklib - Extract ROF modules from OS-9 libraries.SYNOPSIS     unpacklib [-verbose] [-list] file1.l file2.l ...DESCRIPTION     Extract ROF modules from OS-9 libraries. The extracted     modules can be reused to build new libraries.     The main use this program would be to replace modules inside     libraries for which the sources are not available.     This utility is the companion of the liborder program. Both     can be used to reorganize the order of the modules in a     library for which sources are not available.KEYS     verbose List the names of the extracted modules while pro-             cessing.     list    List module names and size only, no extract opera-             tion is performed.SEE ALSO     liborder(1), MicrowareAUTHORS     Antonio Pastore, CERN, CN/CE/MS